WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.199
Before your call, here's the short version.

00:00:03.115 --> 00:00:03.980
Jhana is a state of

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:05.300
deep joy and calm that

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.340
you can learn on purpose.

00:00:07.106 --> 00:00:08.716
It isn't a feat of concentration.

00:00:08.716 --> 00:00:09.976
It's closer to noticing a good

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:11.296
feeling, and letting it grow.

00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:13.748
On our retreats, about fifty-nine in

00:00:13.748 --> 00:00:14.808
a hundred people reached it.

00:00:15.878 --> 00:00:17.285
People come to us for different reasons.

00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:19.351
To enjoy a life that

00:00:19.351 --> 00:00:20.551
already works on paper.

00:00:21.381 --> 00:00:23.103
For a practice that finally delivers.

00:00:23.853 --> 00:00:24.504
To get back to a

00:00:24.504 --> 00:00:25.484
feeling they touched once.

00:00:26.173 --> 00:00:27.455
Or to work through something heavy.

00:00:28.745 --> 00:00:29.532
And most people bring

00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:30.372
the same few doubts.

00:00:31.102 --> 00:00:32.954
What if I don't get there?

00:00:32.954 --> 00:00:34.154
More than a third of those

00:00:34.154 --> 00:00:35.794
who didn't still called it life-changing.

00:00:36.624 --> 00:00:39.323
Will it last? The afterglow fades.

00:00:39.323 --> 00:00:41.223
The skill stays, with practice.

00:00:41.915 --> 00:00:43.277
Can't take a week off? There's an

00:00:43.277 --> 00:00:44.957
online retreat built around your work.

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:47.926
Not the meditating type? People with

00:00:47.926 --> 00:00:49.766
almost no experience reached it more

00:00:49.766 --> 00:00:50.526
than half the time.

00:00:51.657 --> 00:00:52.671
On the call, we'll ask

00:00:52.671 --> 00:00:53.651
what brought you here, and

00:00:53.651 --> 00:00:54.471
you can ask us anything.

00:00:55.181 --> 00:00:56.176
There's no pressure to decide.

00:00:57.106 --> 00:00:58.666
Bring your questions. We'll see you there.
